<title>UK: IBM Intl Finance sets 125 million Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>IBM Intl Finance sets 125 million Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IBM INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.5	 MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    SWISS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  A+/A</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
